      "claim": "Direct human absolute oral bioavailability measurements in all visible L1 contexts are 43-91%; the most structurally relevant nitrile and fused-heteroaromatic contexts (glasdegib 77.12%, AG-221 57.2%, ondansetron 50-65%, GSK1322322 57-77%) all support F≥20%.",
      "card_ids": ["C18","C21","C08","C15","C16","C01","C12","C19","C20"]
